    <cac:ProcurementProject xmlns="">
        <cbc:Name languageID="ENG">CFT to establish a single suppler Framework Agreement For the Provision of a Masters in Software Design with Artificial Intelligence</cbc:Name>
        <cbc:Description languageID="ENG">The Contracting Authority requires the services of a single service provider, with suitable experience and qualified resources, to provide and deliver a one-year Level 9 Masters in Software Design with Artificial Intelligence. The Contracting Authority intends to establish a single-supplier Framework Agreement for the delivery of Master’s programmes. Each programme/cohort commissioned under the Framework Agreement is expected to be delivered over approximately one academic year. The first programme cohort is expected to commence in September 2026. Subject to funding, demand, satisfactory performance and the requirements of the Contracting Authority, further annual cohorts may be commissioned during the term of the Framework Agreement.</cbc:Description>
        <cbc:ProcurementTypeCode listName="contract-nature">services</cbc:ProcurementTypeCode>
